  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Omfattande upprustning av luftfartsinfrastrukturen gjord med hj&#xe4;lp av l&#xe5;n fr&#xe5;n ADB. Institutionella brister samt brister inom s&#xe4;kerhet och drift har f&#xe5;tt l&#xe4;mnas utan &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rd p g a brist p&#xe5; resurser. Sida-st&#xf6;det skall bidra till att r&#xe4;tta till dessa brister.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The civil aviation infrastrukture has been developed financed by loan from ADB. Institutional shortages as well as shortages within thesafety and operational areas have been left due to lack of resources. Sida4s support is to be used for eliminating these shortages.</narrative>
